        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"marimo-with-your-own-private-and-saved-state\">marimo, with your own private <em>and</em> saved state</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook exports to WASM like the root template -- your\nbrowser runs its own private Pyodide (Python-in-WebAssembly)\ninstance, so nobody else can see or touch your copy while you're\nediting it.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The difference: every widget change is also sent to a tiny API\nbundled into this same container, which writes it to a real\n<strong>Aiven for PostgreSQL</strong> service, keyed by a random id stored in\n<em>your</em> browser. Reload the page (same browser) and your widgets\ncome back exactly where you left them.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
