            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Not saved -- API unreachable (<urlopen error [Errno 111] Connection refused>)</strong>. This box's text is saved through the\nsame Postgres bridge as the widgets above, under its own\nnamespace -- reload the page and it comes back, same as they do.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">It isn't this notebook's actual <em>source code</em>, though: a WASM\nexport has no way to read or write its own running cells from\ninside a cell, so there's no supported way to persist edits to\n<code>notebook.py</code> itself here. This is the closest equivalent -- a\nplain string a visitor can edit and get back.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
