          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<span class=\"paragraph\">You're identified as <code>local-pr\u2026</code>, a random id generated\non your first visit and stored in <em>this browser's</em> <code>localStorage</code> --\nno login involved. Reload this page in the same browser and it\ncomes back; open it in a different browser or an incognito window\nand you'll get a brand-new, empty session.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Get the template that made this:\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Aiven-Labs/marimo-runtime\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">github.com/Aiven-Labs/marimo-runtime</a>.</span></span>"
